# 4. Add Lexical / BM25 Retrieval

Do not rely entirely on embeddings for code search.

Code queries frequently contain exact identifiers:

```text
processOrder
validateOtpV2
CustomerDropOff
utmParam
business-loan-orchestrator
FinancialOrderCheckoutServiceImpl
```

These should be handled extremely well by lexical search.

Introduce a lexical retrieval layer.

Preferred implementation:

* OpenSearch/Elasticsearch if already available
* otherwise a lightweight local BM25 implementation
* alternatively use an existing searchable index if the project already has one

Index:

```text
repository
module
package
file
class
method
field
signature
annotations
source code
comments
```

Support:

```text
exact symbol match
prefix match
token match
case-insensitive match
camelCase tokenization
snake_case tokenization
qualified-name matching
```

For example:

```text
processOrder
```

should tokenize/match:

```text
process
order
processOrder
FinancialOrderCheckoutServiceImpl.processOrder
```

