# 5. Implement Hybrid Retrieval

Use:

```text
Lexical + Vector + Graph
```

rather than:

```text
Vector + Graph only
```

Initial retrieval should run lexical and vector searches in parallel when appropriate.

Example:

```text
Query
  |
  +--> BM25
  |
  +--> Qdrant
  |
  +--> Neo4j exact symbol lookup
```

Merge all candidates.

Do not simply concatenate results.

Use a ranking/fusion mechanism.

Initially implement Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF):

```text
RRFScore(d) =
    Σ 1 / (k + rank_i(d))
```

where each retrieval strategy contributes independently.

Keep the implementation extensible so weighted fusion can be introduced later.

