# 12. Improve Candidate Ranking

Create a unified ranking model.

Do not rely solely on cosine similarity.

Candidate score should consider:

```text
semantic similarity
lexical relevance
cross-encoder score
exact symbol match
class match
repository match
package match
graph relevance
graph distance
relationship type
query intent
```

Initially use configurable heuristic weights.

Example:

```text
finalScore =
    semanticWeight * semanticScore
  + lexicalWeight * lexicalScore
  + rerankWeight * rerankScore
  + graphWeight * graphScore
  + symbolWeight * symbolMatch
  + metadataWeight * metadataMatch
```

Do not hard-code weights in multiple services.

Centralize them in configuration.

Example:

```properties
rag.ranking.semantic-weight=0.25
rag.ranking.lexical-weight=0.20
rag.ranking.rerank-weight=0.25
rag.ranking.graph-weight=0.20
rag.ranking.symbol-weight=0.10
```

These values are initial defaults only.

