# 13. Improve Cross-Encoder Reranking

Preserve the current conditional reranking mechanism.

The cross encoder should operate only on a small candidate set.

Recommended flow:

```text
BM25:
    top 20

Vector:
    top 20

Neo4j:
    top 20

Fusion:
    ~20-40 unique candidates

Cross encoder:
    top 20

Final:
    top 5-15
```

Do not send hundreds of documents to the cross encoder.

Preserve the existing optimization where exact graph lookups bypass reranking.

