# 45. Make Repository Scope Explicit

When multiple repositories are ingested, retrieval should distinguish:

```text
repository
module
branch
version
```

Never silently mix different versions of source code.

Where possible include:

```text
commit SHA
branch
repository
```

in graph and vector metadata.

