# 46. Improve Incremental Ingestion

Preserve deterministic IDs and hash-based change detection.

For unchanged files:

```text
AST parse
can be skipped where possible
embedding
can be skipped
summary generation
can be skipped
```

For changed files:

```text
reparse
update changed symbols
remove deleted symbols
update affected relationships
update vectors
regenerate affected summaries
```

Do not rebuild the entire repository unnecessarily.

---

# 47. Handle Deleted Symbols

Incremental ingestion must detect:

```text
deleted class
deleted method
renamed method
moved file
```

Remove stale:

```text
Neo4j nodes
Neo4j relationships
Qdrant points
summaries
metadata
```

Do not leave stale graph nodes that can be retrieved by the RAG system.

---

# 48. Make Cross-Repo Reconciliation Incremental

The current system can relink repositories after ingestion.

Improve this so that a changed repository causes only affected relationships to be reevaluated.

For example:

```text
axis-oms changed
```

should not necessarily reprocess every relationship in:

```text
axis-fd
axis-utilities
other repositories
```

Identify impacted symbols first.

