# 53. Do Not Over-Use Agentic Loops

Do not implement:

```text
LLM
 ↓
search
 ↓
LLM
 ↓
search
 ↓
LLM
 ↓
search
```

for every query.

Prefer deterministic retrieval first.

Only use iterative retrieval when:

```text
